@startuml
title 退款与骑手补偿时序图
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false

actor "顾客" as Customer
participant "顾客端" as UI
participant "购物车与下单服务" as OrderService
participant "退款与售后服务" as RefundService
participant "订单与配送服务" as DeliveryService
participant "菜品与库存服务" as MenuService
participant "商家/管理员" as Reviewer
participant "日志与审计服务" as LogService
database "数据库" as DB

Customer -> UI : 申请退款/售后
UI -> OrderService : applyRefund(orderId, reason)
OrderService -> RefundService : validateRefund(orderId)
RefundService -> DeliveryService : 查询取餐/送达状态
DeliveryService --> RefundService : 配送状态
RefundService -> RefundService : 计算商品退款、配送费退款、平台承担、骑手补偿
RefundService -> Reviewer : 提交退款审核
alt 审核通过
  Reviewer -> RefundService : approve
  RefundService -> OrderService : markRefunded(orderId)
  OrderService -> MenuService : 回补库存（未送达）
  OrderService -> DB : 保存退款记录并更新订单状态
  RefundService -> DeliveryService : 结算骑手补偿
  RefundService --> UI : 退款成功
else 审核驳回
  Reviewer -> RefundService : reject
  RefundService --> UI : 驳回原因
end
RefundService -> LogService : 记录退款、审核和补偿
note over RefundService : 只支持整单退款；已完成订单不退款；已取餐/已送达的配送费归骑手
@enduml
